{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25216","headline":"姑熟杂咏 望夫山 · 李赤","name":"姑熟杂咏 望夫山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顒望临碧空，怨情感离别。\n芳草不知愁，岩花但争发。\n云山万重隔，音信千里绝。\n春去秋复来，相思几时歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李赤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}